# area 59 (05_temple_federationsite_dark): Think's inactive early return (fn_9_C944, 0x0000C970..
# 0x0000C974): the commando (u0417 in this build; `objs commando` lists it) is woken, deactivated
# for 200 frames and woken again.
@f300 objs commando
@f320 send u0417 Activate
@f340 place u0417 player 5
@f400 send u0417 Deactivate
@f600 objs commando
@f620 send u0417 Activate
@f800 objs commando
